sequenceDiagram
    participant Judge as SIH Judge
    participant CLI as jockey CLI
    participant Runtime as JOCKY Runtime
    participant Collectors as Collectors
    participant Evidence as Evidence Store
    participant Correlation as Correlation Engine
    participant Graph as Investigation Graph
    participant Verify as Verification Engine
    participant Export as Export Engine
    participant Dashboard as Frontend Dashboard

    Note over Judge, Dashboard: === SIH DEMO SEQUENCE (8 Steps) ===

    Judge->>CLI: 1. LOAD SAMPLE\n`jockey load sample_case/`
    CLI->>Runtime: Load Plaso CSV
    Runtime->>Evidence: Create synthetic evidence nodes
    Runtime-->>CLI: Evidence loaded (47 events)
    CLI-->>Judge: ✅ Sample loaded: process tree, DNS, registry, file write

    Judge->>CLI: 2. SHOW GRAPH\n`jockey graph show`
    CLI->>Graph: Query investigation graph
    Graph-->>CLI: Causal chain (DOT/Cytoscape)
    CLI-->>Judge: 📊 Graph: svchost → powershell → network → file → registry

    Judge->>CLI: 3. RUN DSL\n`jockey run investigate.jky`
    CLI->>Runtime: Parse → AST → IR → Contract → Execute
    Runtime->>Collectors: Dispatch collection steps
    Collectors-->>Runtime: Evidence + Receipts
    Runtime->>Evidence: Persist
    Runtime->>Correlation: Apply rules
    Correlation->>Graph: Build graph
    Graph->>Graph: Bind hypotheses
    Runtime-->>CLI: Investigation complete
    CLI-->>Judge: ✅ Investigation executed: 3 findings, 12 correlations

    Judge->>CLI: 4. COMPILE\n`jockey compile investigate.jky`
    CLI->>CLI: Lower IR → Backend Targets
    CLI-->>Judge: 📄 Generated:\n  • hunt.vql (Velociraptor)\n  • kape_targets.json (KAPE)\n  • evidence.case.json (CASE/UCO)

    Judge->>CLI: 5. EXPORT NARRATIVE\n`jockey narrative`
    CLI->>Export: Generate Markdown report
    Export-->>CLI: evidence_report.md
    CLI-->>Judge: 📋 Report: Causal story with evidence citations

    Judge->>CLI: 6. VERIFY INTEGRITY\n`jockey verify`
    CLI->>Verify: Check receipts + provenance
    Verify-->>CLI: VerificationReport: PASS
    CLI-->>Judge: 🔐 Verification: All 47 receipts valid, hash chain intact

    Judge->>CLI: 7. TAMPER DEMO\n(Modify evidence file)
    CLI->>CLI: `echo "tampered" >> evidence/ULID.jsonl`
    Judge->>CLI: `jockey verify`
    CLI->>Verify: Re-verify
    Verify-->>CLI: VerificationReport: FAIL\n  Evidence ULID: hash mismatch\n  Provenance chain broken at record #3
    CLI-->>Judge: ❌ Verification FAILED - Tamper detected!

    Judge->>CLI: (Restore original evidence)
    CLI->>CLI: `git checkout evidence/ULID.jsonl`
    Judge->>CLI: `jockey verify`
    CLI->>Verify: Re-verify
    Verify-->>CLI: VerificationReport: PASS
    CLI-->>Judge: ✅ Verification PASSED - Integrity restored

    Judge->>CLI: 8. CLOSE
    CLI-->>Judge: "One script. Three backends.\nComplete evidence chain. Zero post-processing."